      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天周末，我们多走一会儿吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我今天时间很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你想走多久？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "一个小时怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以，不过中间可以休息一下。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我最近走路比以前多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你自己感觉怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "上楼的时候没那么累了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这就是慢慢坚持的好处。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我发现走路比我想的容易坚持。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "因为不用特别准备，也不用花钱。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且走完以后心情也比较好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那边有长椅，我们到那里休息。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，休息五分钟再继续。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天不用走得太快。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，舒服一点儿更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "以后周末可以把这条路线走完。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc016_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，就把它当成我们的周末习惯。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
